  "details": "The Hatsuine Miku YOZORA Program 2026 bundle was removed from the shop on October 4, 2026, but the promotion aclaiming \"on sale now!\" remains unexpectedly in the VRChat Home world several days later.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Launch into the [VRChat Home](https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_4432ea9b-729c-46e3-8eaf-846aa0a37fdd/info) world (`wrld_4432ea9b-729c-46e3-8eaf-846aa0a37fdd`). Please ignore the outdated world photo on the world page.\n\n2. Look around, to the left and right side of the mirror.\n\nExpected result: While I'd prefer no ads and the shop listing removal is intended, I think changing the world's current promotion to the Cosmic Princess Kaguya! bundle would make sense.\n\nActual result: \"The Official Hatsune Miku YOZORA Program 2026 Bundle is on sale now!\" is displayed in the world incorrectly, and not found in the shop anymore. New user confusion may ensue.",
